  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to a coherent and coordinated UN support for migration management. 2020-2021.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the engagement is to i) supporting the UN system in contributing to a coherent and coordinated migration management, focusing on building capacities at country level and breaking down silos in the UN cooperation on migration; and ii) contributing to the overall Danish efforts to reduce irregular migration and make existing migration more safe, orderly and regular.</narrative>
  </description>
